sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Shell as lumen-shell
    participant Bridge as ZlmPolicyBridge
    participant Comp as lumen-compositor
    participant App as focused app

    User->>Shell: click window B titlebar
    Shell->>Bridge: request_activate(toplevel_B)
    Bridge->>Comp: activate + restack(B on top)
    Comp->>Comp: SeatManager.setFocus(B)
    Comp->>Comp: resolve_keyboard_focus()
    alt exclusive layer surface mapped on top/overlay
        Note over Comp,App: keys stay with it (only its own popups can take them); B is the WM's choice but not activated
    else popup grab active and its topmost grabbing popup mapped
        Note over Comp,App: keys stay with that popup (B is another client: the grab is dismissed first)
    else
        Comp->>App: wl_keyboard.enter(B's surface)
    end
    Comp->>Shell: focus_changed(B)

    User->>App: right-click (press serial S)
    App->>Comp: xdg_surface.get_popup + xdg_popup.grab(S)
    Comp->>Comp: S == App's last press? push on the grab stack
    Comp->>App: configure -> ack -> commit (popup maps)
    Comp->>App: wl_keyboard.enter(popup): B stays activated
    User->>Comp: press outside App's surfaces
    Comp->>App: popup_done (topmost first), press consumed
    Comp->>App: wl_keyboard.enter(B's surface)
